        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Nich Yaka Misyachna\n- People: Mykola Lysenko, Mykhailo Starytsky, Evgeny Belyaev, Boris Alexandrov\n- Organizations: Alexandrov Ensemble\n- Places: Klintsy\n- Roles: Russian tenor soloist\n\nFacts:\n- Nich Yaka Misyachna is a Ukrainian song composed by Mykola Lysenko with lyrics from a poem by Mykhailo Starytsky.\n- Evgeny Mikhailovich Belyaev, also written as Yevgeny Belyayev, was born in Klintsy on 11 September 1926.\n- Evgeny Belyaev was a Russian tenor soloist of the Alexandrov Ensemble under Boris Alexandrov.\n- Evgeny Belyaev died on 21 or 22 February 1994.",
